Package: CNKfarmastatr
Type: Package
Title: Reproducible Pharmaceutical Statistics for Education and Research
Version: 1.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Kıvanç", "Yüksel", email = "kivancyuksel@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Statistical core of the CNK-FarmaStatR platform. Implements
    model-independent multivariate statistical distance (MSD) for dissolution
    profile comparison (Tsong et al. 1996), Weibull model-dependent MSD
    (Sathe et al. 1996), f2 and bootstrap f2 with EMA and FDA perspectives
    (EMA Q&A 3.11; Xu et al. 2021), and in vitro population bioequivalence
    (FDA PSG 020929). Each statistical model is validated once against
    analytic cases and published examples. For research and education; not
    a validated system for GxP environments.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats, utils
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Collate: 'msd_core.R' 'msd_weibull.R' 'f2_boot.R' 'f2_noce_data.R'
    'dis_ornek_veri.R' 'pbe_core.R' 'pbe_kopru.R' 'pbe_ornek_veri.R'
    'sim_performance.R' 'sim_run.R' 'sim_scenario_demo.R' 'invitro_fast.R'
    'invitro_grid.R' 'platform_input.R' 'platform_hipotez.R'
    'platform_export.R' 'platform_tasarim.R' 'platform_analiz.R'
